   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Framework Agreement 2013, DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">All operations are implemented within DRC&apos;s international mandate - the protection of refugees and internally displaced people and the promotion of durable solutions with three strategic objectives: a) Saving of lives and alleviation of suffering, b) the restoration and development of livelihoods, and c) strengthening the capacity of relevant institutions in the affected countries. DRC shares the core values and ambitions outlined in the Strategy for Danish Humanitarian Action 2010-2015, Denmark&apos;s Development Strategy as revised in 2012, and Denmark&#xbf;s policy for interventions in fragile states, 2010-2015.</narrative>
  </description>
